Credits.  The mollified moments and the proportion 19/27 of simple zeros are due to H. M. Bui and
D. R. Heath-Brown, Bull. London Math. Soc. 45 (2013), after J. B. Conrey, A. Ghosh and S. M. Gonek.  The part of
